Package: cognac
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: John Hauger Mitander <john@mitander.io>
Homepage: https://github.com/John0n1/cognac
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, coreutils, tar, xz-utils
Description: intelligent Windows application installer for Linux
 Cognac analyzes Windows executables, provisions a managed compatibility
 environment, installs applications, and integrates them with the Linux desktop.
